GATE NOTES (transparency — Honesty Covenant #9 no silent drift)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Module path: the prompt's gate text addresses `:app:`, but the Gradle module in this repo is `:android:`
   (settings.gradle.kts: include(":android"), projectDir=app; comment: "every P3/A* prompt gate addresses
   `:android:`"). The gate below was run with `:android:` so the tasks actually resolve; `:app:...` would
   error with "project ':app' not found". Same adaptation the sibling feature-view gates record.
2. The UI/a11y test (ChargerSpecsPanelUiTest.kt) is an androidTest (connectedAndroidTest) instrumented test;
   it compiles + passes ktlint/detekt here but is NOT executed by the offline gate (no emulator; outside
   testReleaseUnitTest). The pure projection is fully covered by the testReleaseUnitTest run below.
3. SI on the wire, display at the boundary: SpecEntry carries energyWh (watt-hours) + avgPowerW (watts); the
   kWh/kW conversion is a display-only /1000 in the projection (web convertEnergyFromSI/convertPowerFromSI),
   never a stored unit-suffixed field — matches the repo SI-canonical mandate + the ChargerTypeChart sibling.

